{"story_id":72389,"updated_at":"2026-11-11T17:24:25","headline_en":"Safety of 18 crew members confirmed following Persian Gulf tanker attack","headline_hi":"पर्शियन खाड़ी में टैंकर पर हमले के बाद 18 चालक दल के सदस्यों की सुरक्षा की पुष्टि हुई","payload_en":{"story_id":72389,"headline":"Safety of 18 crew members confirmed following Persian Gulf tanker attack","counts":{"articles":7,"independent_sources":6,"outlets":7},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Anadolu Agency","Firstpost","Free Press Journal","Gulf News","India Today","The Hindu","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":72389,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-11T17:24:25","category":{"v":2,"primary":["world"],"secondary":["diplomacy","conflicts"],"tertiary":["diaspora","wars"]},"places":[],"people":["Arabian Gulf","Persian Gulf","for Ports Shipping and Waterways Sarbananda Sonowal","The MT Fujairah Energy","VLCC MT Fujairah Energy","The UK Maritime Trade Operations","Hormuz","Liberia-flagged VLCC MT FUJAIRAH"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"\"The remaining 18 crew members, including the other 5 Indian seafarers, are safe and accounted for.\", Union Minister for Ports.","ids":[121928],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6]}],[{"text":"The Liberia-flagged VLCC MT Fujairah Energy was hit by a projectile while transiting the Persian Gulf.","ids":[121918],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"On Wednesday, a Liberia-flagged tanker was struck by a projectile while transiting the Persian Gulf.","ids":[121924],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"Four crew members were injured in the attack.","ids":[121951],"class":"partial","sources":[4,5]},{"text":"On Wednesday, four crew members were injured in the incident.","ids":[121925],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Indian Shipping Minister Sarbananda Sonowal made a statement regarding the attack on the vessel.","ids":[121919],"class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"text":"\"Four crew members sustained injuries in the attack,\" Sonowal said on Tuesday, adding that \"On Nov 10, Liberia-flagged VLCC MT FUJAIRAH ENERGY, carrying 6 Indian seafarers, was hit by a projectile….\" One Indian national suffered minor injuries and was taken ashore for medical examination, and the MT Fujairah Energy was carrying six Indian seafarers.","ids":[121921,121942,121922,121952],"class":"single","sources":[2,3,4,5,6]}],[{"text":"The vessel was transiting to Sonowal said.","ids":[121945],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"\"The Liberia-flagged supertanker VLCC MT Fujairah Energy was hit by a projectile while transiting the Arabian Gulf,\" India’s Ports, Shipping and Sonowal said on 10 November","ids":[121931],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"\"A Liberia-flagged oil tanker was hit by a projectile while transiting the Persian Gulf,\" Union minister for ports.","ids":[121937],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The UK Maritime Trade Operations received a report of an incident involving a tanker in the Strait of Hormuz.","ids":[121935],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"One Indian national was among the four crew members injured.","ids":[121927],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"\"We are continuously monitoring the situation and remain in close contact with the ship management company to ensure the ongoing security, medical care and well-being of our seafarers,\" India’s Ports.","ids":[121955,121956],"class":"unverified","sources":[4,6]}],[{"text":"The UK Maritime Trade Operations advised vessels in the area to exercise caution and report suspicious activity.","ids":[121936],"class":"single","sources":[4]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","say","say","numbers","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/india/dubai-bound-tanker-carrying-6-indian-seafarers-hit-by-projectile-in-persian-gulf-one-injured-says-govt","outlet":"Free Press Journal","title":"Dubai-Bound Tanker Carrying 6 Indian Seafarers Hit By Projectile In Persian Gulf; One Injured, Says Govt","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"Indian seafarer injured as projectile hits Liberia-flagged oil tanker in Persian Gulf","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/4-wounded-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-vessel-in-gulf/4119767","outlet":"Anadolu Agency","title":"4 wounded as projectile hits Liberia-flagged vessel in Gulf","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","outlet":"Gulf News","title":"Four injured as tanker with Indian crew hit by projectile in Arabian Gulf","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/persian-gulf-tanker-attack-indian-among-four-injured-aboard-mt-fujairah-energy-vessel-hit-by-projectile-3036525-2026-11-11","outlet":"India Today","title":"Dubai-bound oil tanker carrying 6 Indians hit in Persian Gulf, 4 crew injured","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":6,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Liberia-flagged VLCC hit in Persian Gulf, six Indian seafarers aboard: Sarbananda Sonowal","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":7,"url":"https://www.firstpost.com/india/dubai-bound-tanker-carrying-6-indians-hit-by-projectile-in-persian-gulf-1-injured-govt-monitoring-situation-14059185.html","outlet":"Firstpost","title":"Dubai-bound tanker carrying 6 Indians hit by projectile in Persian Gulf, 1 injured; govt monitoring situati...","perspective":"–","read":false,"readable":false}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"At least 22 Indian nationals have been killed since the war broke out in February.","ids":[121949],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Regional tensions have remained high since the US and Israel launched attacks on Iran on Feb. 28.","ids":[121947],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"Last month, the Panama-flagged tanker MT Louise 1 was struck by limpet mines in the Strait of Hormuz.","ids":[121954],"class":"single","sources":[5]},{"text":"India has lost 23 nationals in the ongoing West Asia conflict.","ids":[121938],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"37 ships were attacked in the Strait of Hormuz and surrounding waterways in October.","ids":[121929],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"15 Indian seafarers have died in the ongoing West Asia conflict.","ids":[121930],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Indian seafarer Gandhar Nahim Ajij was killed when a commercial vessel came under attack off the coast of Oman.","ids":[121939],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"The war has disrupted navigation through the Strait of Hormuz.","ids":[121948],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"The incident has heightened concerns over commercial shipping safety amid the Iran-US conflict.","ids":[121953],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],"who":[null,null,null,null,"Shipping Minister Sarbananda Sonowal","Indian Shipping Minister Sarbananda Sonowal","India’s Ports, Shipping and Waterways Minister Sarbananda Sonowal","Union minister for ports, shipping and waterways Sarbananda Sonowal","UK Maritime Trade Operations",null,null,null]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"Four crew members sustained injuries in the attack.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Anadolu Agency","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/4-wounded-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-vessel-in-gulf/4119767","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"One Indian national suffered minor injuries and was taken ashore for medical examination.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":3,"sources":[{"outlet":"India Today","url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/persian-gulf-tanker-attack-indian-among-four-injured-aboard-mt-fujairah-energy-vessel-hit-by-projectile-3036525-2026-11-11","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"The remaining 18 crew members, including five Indian seafarers, are safe and accounted for.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/india/dubai-bound-tanker-carrying-6-indian-seafarers-hit-by-projectile-in-persian-gulf-one-injured-says-govt","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Anadolu Agency","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/