":"The Liberia-flagged supertanker VLCC MT Fujairah Energy was hit by a projectile while transiting the Arabian Gulf.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"The UK Maritime Trade Operations received a report of an incident involving a tanker in the Strait of Hormuz.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"A Liberia-flagged oil tanker was hit by a projectile while transiting the Persian Gulf.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"Indian Shipping Minister Sarbananda Sonowal stated that the vessel was hit by a projectile.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":0,"sources":[{"outlet":"Anadolu Agency","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/4-wounded-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-vessel-in-gulf/4119767","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"India Today","url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/persian-gulf-tanker-attack-indian-among-four-injured-aboard-mt-fujairah-energy-vessel-hit-by-projectile-3036525-2026-11-11","stance":"asserts"}]},{"text":"The vessel was transiting to Dubai.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":0,"sources":[{"outlet":"Anadolu Agency","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/4-wounded-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-vessel-in-gulf/4119767","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"Four crew members were injured in the attack.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"India Today","url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/persian-gulf-tanker-attack-indian-among-four-injured-aboard-mt-fujairah-energy-vessel-hit-by-projectile-3036525-2026-11-11","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"}]}],"context":[{"text":"The Indian government is monitoring the situation.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"The Indian government is in contact with the ship management company.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"The UK Maritime Trade Operations advised vessels in the area to exercise caution and report suspicious activity.","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":1,"sources":[{"outlet":"Gulf News","url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","stance":"attributes"}]}]},"payload_hi":{"story_id":72389,"headline":"पर्शियन खाड़ी में टैंकर पर हमले के बाद 18 चालक दल के सदस्यों की सुरक्षा की पुष्टि हुई","counts":{"articles":7,"independent_sources":6,"outlets":7},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Anadolu Agency","Firstpost","Free Press Journal","Gulf News","India Today","The Hindu","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":72389,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-11T17:24:25","category":{"v":2,"primary":["world"],"secondary":["diplomacy","conflicts"],"tertiary":["diaspora","wars"]},"places":[],"people":["Arabian Gulf","Persian Gulf","for Ports Shipping and Waterways Sarbananda Sonowal","The MT Fujairah Energy","VLCC MT Fujairah Energy","The UK Maritime Trade Operations","Hormuz","Liberia-flagged VLCC MT FUJAIRAH"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"\"अन्य 5 भारतीय नाविकों सहित शेष 18 चालक दल के सदस्य सुरक्षित हैं और उनकी मौजूदगी की पुष्टि हो चुकी है,\" केंद्रीय बंदरगाह मंत्री।","ids":[121928],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6]}],[{"text":"लाइबेरिया के ध्वज वाले वीएलसीसी एमटी फुजैरा एनर्जी को पर्शियन खाड़ी से गुजरते समय एक प्रोजेक्टाइल से मारा गया।","ids":[121918],"class":"single","sources":[6]},{"text":"बुधवार को, लाइबेरिया के ध्वज वाले एक टैंकर को पर्शियन खाड़ी से गुजरते समय एक प्रोजेक्टाइल से मारा गया।","ids":[121924],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"हमले में चालक दल के चार सदस्य घायल हुए।","ids":[121951],"class":"partial","sources":[4,5]},{"text":"बुधवार को, घटना में चालक दल के चार सदस्य घायल हो गए।","ids":[121925],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"भारतीय शिपिंग मंत्री सर्बानंद सोनोवाल ने जहाज पर हुए हमले के संबंध में एक बयान दिया।","ids":[121919],"class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"text":"\"हमले में चालक दल के चार सदस्य घायल हो गए,\" सोनोवाल ने मंगलवार को कहा, और जोड़ा कि \"10 नवंबर को, 6 भारतीय नाविकों को ले जा रहे लाइबेरिया के ध्वज वाले वीएलसीसी एमटी फुजैरा एनर्जी को एक प्रोजेक्टाइल से मारा गया था....\" एक भारतीय नागरिक को मामूली चोटें आईं और उसे चिकित्सा जांच के लिए तट पर ले जाया गया, और एमटी फुजैरा एनर्जी पर छह भारतीय नाविक सवार थे।","ids":[121921,121942,121922,121952],"class":"single","sources":[2,3,4,5,6]}],[{"text":"जहाज जा रहा था, सोनोवाल ने कहा।","ids":[121945],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"\"लाइबेरिया के ध्वज वाले सुपरटैंकर वीएलसीसी एमटी फुजैरा एनर्जी को अरब खाड़ी से गुजरते समय एक प्रोजेक्टाइल से मारा गया,\" भारत के बंदरगाह, शिपिंग और सोनोवाल ने 10 नवंबर को कहा","ids":[121931],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"\"लाइबेरिया के ध्वज वाले एक तेल टैंकर को पर्शियन खाड़ी से गुजरते समय एक प्रोजेक्टाइल से मारा गया,\" बंदरगाहों के केंद्रीय मंत्री ने कहा।","ids":[121937],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"यूके मैरीटाइम ट्रेड ऑपरेशंस को होर्मुज स्ट्रेट में एक टैंकर से जुड़ी घटना की रिपोर्ट मिली।","ids":[121935],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"घायल हुए चालक दल के चार सदस्यों में एक भारतीय नागरिक शामिल था।","ids":[121927],"class":"single","sources":[1,3]}],[{"text":"\"हम लगातार स्थिति पर नजर रख रहे हैं और अपने नाविकों की निरंतर सुरक्षा, चिकित्सा देखभाल और भलाई सुनिश्चित करने के लिए जहाज प्रबंधन कंपनी के साथ घनिष्ठ संपर्क में हैं,\" भारत के बंदरगाह।","ids":[121955,121956],"class":"unverified","sources":[4,6]}],[{"text":"यूके मैरीटाइम ट्रेड ऑपरेशंस ने क्षेत्र के जहाजों को सावधानी बरतने और संदिग्ध गतिविधि की रिपोर्ट करने की सलाह दी।","ids":[121936],"class":"single","sources":[4]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","say","say","numbers","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/india/dubai-bound-tanker-carrying-6-indian-seafarers-hit-by-projectile-in-persian-gulf-one-injured-says-govt","outlet":"Free Press Journal","title":"Dubai-Bound Tanker Carrying 6 Indian Seafarers Hit By Projectile In Persian Gulf; One Injured, Says Govt","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"Indian seafarer injured as projectile hits Liberia-flagged oil tanker in Persian Gulf","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/4-wounded-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-vessel-in-gulf/4119767","outlet":"Anadolu Agency","title":"4 wounded as projectile hits Liberia-flagged vessel in Gulf","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/four-injured-as-tanker-with-indian-crew-hit-by-projectile-in-arabian-gulf-1.500743272","outlet":"Gulf News","title":"Four injured as tanker with Indian crew hit by projectile in Arabian Gulf","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/persian-gulf-tanker-attack-indian-among-four-injured-aboard-mt-fujairah-energy-vessel-hit-by-projectile-3036525-2026-11-11","outlet":"India Today","title":"Dubai-bound oil tanker carrying 6 Indians hit in Persian Gulf, 4 crew injured","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":6,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Liberia-flagged VLCC hit in Persian Gulf, six Indian seafarers aboard: Sarbananda Sonowal","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":7,"url":"https://www.firstpost.com/india/dubai-bound-tanker-carrying-6-indians-hit-by-projectile-in-persian-gulf-1-injured-govt-monitoring-situation-14059185.html","outlet":"Firstpost","title":"Dubai-bound tanker carrying 6 Indians hit by projectile in Persian Gulf, 1 injured; govt monitoring situati...","perspective":"–","read":false,"readable":false}],"other_coverage":[{"text":"फरवरी में युद्ध शुरू होने के बाद से कम से कम 22 भारतीय नागरिक मारे गए हैं।","ids":[121949],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"28 फरवरी को ईरान पर अमेरिका और इजरायल द्वारा हमले शुरू करने के बाद से क्षेत्रीय तनाव अधिक बना हुआ है।","ids":[121947],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"पिछले महीने, पनामा के ध्वज वाले टैंकर एमटी लुईस 1 को होर्मुज स्ट्रेट में लिम्पेट माइन्स से मारा गया था।","ids":[121954],"class":"single","sources":[5]},{"text":"भारत ने चल रहे पश्चिम एशिया संघर्ष में 23 नागरिकों को खो दिया है।","ids":[121938],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"अक्टूबर में होर्मुज स्ट्रेट और आसपास के वाटरवेज़ में 37 जहाजों पर हमला किया गया था।","ids":[121929],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"चल रहे पश्चिम एशिया संघर्ष में 15 भारतीय नाविकों की मौत हो चुकी है।","ids":[121930],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"भारतीय नाविक गांधर नाहिम अजीज की ओमान के तट पर एक वाणिज्यिक जहाज पर हमले के दौरान मौत हो गई।","ids":[121939],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"युद्ध ने होर्मुज स्ट्रेट के माध्यम से नेविगेशन को बाधित कर दिया है।","ids":[121948],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"ईरान-यूएस संघर्ष के बीच इस घटना ने वाणिज्यिक जहाज़रानी की सुरक्षा को लेकर चिंताओं को बढ़ा दिया है।","ids":[121953],"class":"single","sources":[5]}]},"timeline":[],"undated":[],"established":[],"contested":[{"text":"हमले में चालक दल के चार सदस्य घायल हो गए।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":2,"sources":[{"outlet":"Anadolu Agency","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/4-wounded-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-vessel-in-gulf/4119767","stance":"asserts"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarbananda-sonowal/article71688307.ece","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indian-seafarer-injured-as-projectile-hits-liberia-flagged-oil-tanker-in-persian-gulf/articleshow/135724389.cms","stance":"attributes"}]},{"text":"एक भारतीय नागरिक को मामूली चोटें आईं और उसे चिकित्सा जांच के लिए तट पर ले जाया गया।","verdict":"unverified","n_sources":3,"sources":[{"outlet":"India Today","url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/persian-gulf-tanker-attack-indian-among-four-injured-aboard-mt-fujairah-energy-vessel-hit-by-projectile-3036525-2026-11-11","stance":"attributes"},{"outlet":"The Hindu","url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/liberia-flagged-vlcc-hit-in-persian-gulf-six-indian-seafarers-aboard-sarban